# Cloudflare Pages redirects — https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
# Format: <from> <to> <status>. The FIRST matching rule wins, so specific rules go above catch-alls.
#
# Purpose: keep old Wix links (Google results, Instagram bio, shared links) working.
# Wix's Portfolio app served projects at /portfolio-collections/my-portfolio/<old-slug>.
# Some Wix templates used /project-page/<old-slug> instead; those variants are included
# just in case (unverified — harmless if never hit). Check the old URLs in Google Search
# Console → Pages, or by searching `site:yourdomain.com` before cancelling Wix.

# --- Old Wix pages ---
/portfolio      /#work   301
/portfolio/     /#work   301
/portfolio-1    /#work   301
/about-me       /about   301
/about-me/      /about   301

